# Project R8 rules. AGP combines every file in src/main/keepRules and passes it to R8.

# Glance runs widget ActionCallbacks by reflection (class name -> no-arg constructor). Glance's own rule
# keeps the class but not its constructor, so R8 dropped it and the Month Pulse period pill did nothing
# in release and fast builds. Keep the constructor (and onAction's name, for stack traces).
-keep class * implements androidx.glance.appwidget.action.ActionCallback {
    public <init>();
    public *** onAction(...);
}
